svc('ollama-local','llm','Local inference; no service usage credits.','Optional local Responses-compatible runner, e.g. operator-selected qwen3:8b; same text stages and frozen model digest.','Hardware/latency/semantic quality unobserved. Use local model tags, not cloud models; never silently switch from subscription after quota failure.',['https://docs.ollama.com/api/openai-compatibility'],'offline_alternative')
svc('claude-included-api','llm','Current Max5x/20x and Team include monthly Claude Console API allowance; Pro is not eligible.','Optional Anthropic Messages adapter for all text roles.','Requires claiming included allowance in a linked Console organization; no purchased balance, invoice overage or auto-reload. Not needed with existing ChatGPT Pro. Current entitlement $100/$200 Max allowance; account eligibility must be observed.',['https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/about-claude/api-credits-for-subscribers'],'do_not_buy_for_starter')
